00:24:53.320 --> 00:24:54.000
Ah, yes.

00:24:54.300 --> 00:24:56.360
Now, this needs quite a bit of work on it.

00:24:58.240 --> 00:24:59.980
Can I have a volunteer to clean...

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:23.780
the church hall toilet area adjacent to the organ loft. There's a fire going over. So

00:25:23.780 --> 00:25:27.380
if you two ladies... Excuse me, excuse, excuse, excuse, excuse, excuse, excuse, excuse.

00:25:30.510 --> 00:25:31.490
What are you doing?

00:25:31.670 --> 00:25:34.030
I've come to help with the church cleaning for that dishy vicar.

00:25:38.240 --> 00:25:40.800
I'd forgotten all about church cleaning.

00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:43.760
I was supposed to take higher since church cleaning.

00:25:43.940 --> 00:25:45.640
Guess who's in the deep and murky then.

00:25:45.860 --> 00:25:49.440
I've told you, you've got to take an aggressive line.

00:25:49.780 --> 00:25:52.120
I will. I rather think I will.

00:25:52.440 --> 00:25:54.680
I mean, even when you're sober.

00:25:56.590 --> 00:25:57.870
I don't know about sober.

00:26:15.200 --> 00:26:20.230
there that the vicar's wife wants removing, so I said I'd do it. It needs someone with a good head

00:26:20.230 --> 00:26:27.720
back. Someone with a longer skirt. Rose, I forbid you to go up that ladder wearing that skirt.

00:26:28.460 --> 00:26:29.780
Do you want me to take it off then?

00:26:32.650 --> 00:26:36.450
Of course not. Though I doubt if anybody had noticed the difference.

00:26:46.590 --> 00:26:49.120
Chad, where have you been?

00:26:49.460 --> 00:26:51.080
Oh, here and there.

00:26:52.640 --> 00:26:54.860
Oslo, I hope you haven't been leading him astray.

00:26:55.450 --> 00:26:59.250
He was only our first attempt. We got nowhere near as far as astray.

00:27:05.850 --> 00:27:08.510
Well, now, you can take Rose home.

00:27:08.930 --> 00:27:10.680
Rose? What's she doing here?

00:27:11.290 --> 00:27:14.430
She volunteered to help with the church cleaning.

00:27:15.410 --> 00:27:16.290
Where is she then?

00:27:16.810 --> 00:27:17.650
She's over there.

00:27:37.840 --> 00:27:38.300
In my regards.

00:27:38.790 --> 00:27:41.960
Isn't it a lovely day?

00:27:42.280 --> 00:27:42.880
Oh, yes indeed.

00:27:43.100 --> 00:27:44.920
It's really disgusting.

00:27:44.960 --> 00:27:45.580
It's really disgusting.

00:27:45.680 --> 00:27:47.860
But they look rather dull in this kind of life.
